<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed lower in moderate trading Wednesday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average fell 42.07 to 7718.71.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite fell 1.68 to 463.41.</p>
<p>The average price per share fell $0.16.</p>
<p>Decliners edged advancers 1294 to 1192.</p>
<p>Volume was 491,683,870 compared with 542,949,960 on Tuesday.</p>
